/*
Problem Description

Simon owns a welding company and has purchased various types of metal for producing different products.



To weld two metals together, he needs to know the temperature of each specific metal in degrees Fahrenheit. Unfortunately, the raw materials imported are provided with temperatures in degrees Celsius.



Simon needs your help to convert these temperatures to degrees Fahrenheit. Can you assist him?

*/

#include<stdio.h>
void main(){ float a;
	scanf("%f",&a);
	printf("%0.2f\n",a*9/5+32);
}

